  "name": "49 · Weekly Business Summary (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 49 · Weekly Business Summary\nEvery Friday 6 PM it reads your **Leads, Sales, Expenses, Tickets and Tasks** sheets (filled by the other agents), works out the week's numbers in code, and AI writes a one-screen summary with 3 things to do next week. By email and WhatsApp.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Use the same sheet as your other agents. Each tab needs a Date (or Created / Received / Added) column; Sales and Expenses need Amount.\n2. Gmail nodes: add a **Gmail OAuth2** credential. Replace YOUR_OWNER_EMAIL.\n3. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nMissing a tab? Delete that node and reconnect the line.",
        "height": 679,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
