    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Each tab needs a date column: Date / Created / Received / Added (yyyy-mm-dd ...). Amount columns: Sales.Amount, Expenses.Amount\nconst num = v => Number(String(v ?? '').replace(/[^0-9.-]/g, '')) || 0;\nconst start = $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').minus({ days: 6 }).startOf('day');\nconst week = n => $(n).all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => { const d = String(r.Date || r.Created || r.Received || r.Added || '').slice(0, 10); return d && DateTime.fromISO(d, { zone: 'Asia/Kolkata' }) >= start; });\nconst L = week('Leads'), S = week('Sales'), E = week('Expenses'), T = week('Tickets'), K = week('Tasks');\nconst sum = a => a.reduce((s, r) => s + num(r.Amount), 0);\nconst st = (a, k) => a.reduce((m, r) => (m[r[k] || 'unknown'] = (m[r[k] || 'unknown'] || 0) + 1, m), {});\nreturn [{ json: { week: `${start.toFormat('d LLL')} – ${$now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('d LLL yyyy')}`, leads: L.length, lead_status: st(L, 'Status'), lead_sources: st(L, 'Source'),\n  sales_count: S.length, sales: sum(S), spent: sum(E), net: sum(S) - sum(E), top_spend: Object.entries(E.reduce((m, r) => (m[r.Category || 'Other'] = (m[r.Category || 'Other'] || 0) + num(r.Amount), m), {})).sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1]).slice(0, 3),\n  tickets: T.length, ticket_status: st(T, 'Status'), high_priority: T.filter(r => String(r.Priority).toLowerCase() === 'high').length,\n  tasks: K.length, tasks_done: K.filter(r => String(r.Status).toLowerCase() === 'done').length } }];"
      },
      "id": "8aff0316-d260-4570-b296-08c3b294005d",
      "name": "This week's numbers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write the Friday weekly summary for the owner of YOUR BUSINESS NAME from these exact numbers (₹):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 1) }}\n\nSections with short lines: 💰 Money (sales, spent, net, top 3 spends), 🎯 Leads (count, status, best source), 🛠️ Support (tickets, high priority, still open), ✅ Team (tasks done of total). Then '3 things to do next week': practical, based only on these numbers. Indian commas for ₹. Never invent numbers; if a section has 0, say so. Max 18 lines. Output only the message.",
        "hasOutputParser": false
      },
